WEBVTT

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:32.980
<b>Imihama Watch
Shimobuki Base</b>

00:01:36.100 --> 00:01:40.500
I use my Hellfire Hammer to 
attack your Life Points directly.

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:40.740
<b>Fiendish Trap</b>

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:40.740
<b>Fiendish Trap</b>

00:01:41.090 --> 00:01:43.120
Now, how will you defend?

00:01:43.760 --> 00:01:45.240
I lose.

00:01:45.740 --> 00:01:46.720
Hey.

00:01:47.380 --> 00:01:50.690
Hey, now. That's not right.

00:01:52.450 --> 00:01:56.230
C'mon, you've got this card 
here, right? Brass Shield.

00:01:56.230 --> 00:01:59.300
After you defend with that, 
you can use Verdant Tree Sprout to—

00:01:58.730 --> 00:02:00.130
I lose.

00:02:00.130 --> 00:02:03.380
I lose. I lose.

00:02:03.670 --> 00:02:06.390
I lose. I lose.

00:02:06.390 --> 00:02:07.890
Enough.

00:02:07.090 --> 00:02:08.200
I lose.

00:02:07.890 --> 00:02:09.900
This is going nowhere.

00:02:08.890 --> 00:02:09.900
I lose.

00:02:11.010 --> 00:02:14.830
Christ. Can't even play a game properly.

00:02:15.250 --> 00:02:18.550
People are finished once 
they lose their sense of humor.

00:02:21.920 --> 00:02:26.150
So you finally decided to show up.
 I was getting sick of waiting.

00:02:28.620 --> 00:02:31.960
<i>Uh, testing, testing. Testing, testing.</i>

00:02:32.300 --> 00:02:37.410
<i>This is an official announcement from 
Imihama Prefecture's governor, Kurokawa.</i>

00:02:38.320 --> 00:02:41.280
<i>This is a scheduled warning 
to wanted criminal</i>

00:02:41.280 --> 00:02:45.350
<i>Akaboshi Bisco, as well as Nekoyanagi Milo.</i>

00:02:45.780 --> 00:02:50.170
<i>You two must still be in 
Touhoku's broadcast range, right?</i>

00:02:50.680 --> 00:02:54.350
<i>Then it's show-time.</i>

00:02:55.710 --> 00:02:58.190
<i>Nekoyanagi-kyun.</i>

00:02:58.420 --> 00:03:01.810
<i>Your older sister is beautiful, 
but also dumb as a rock,</i>

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:06.580
<i>so she didn't know I had 
Akaboshi's old coot in my clutches.</i>

00:03:07.490 --> 00:03:11.960
<i>See how helpful the staff skills she prides 
herself on are when a hostage is involved?</i>

00:03:12.580 --> 00:03:17.940
<i>With her monstrous strength, 
this woman could easily beat me to death,</i>

00:03:18.290 --> 00:03:24.270
<i>but for some reason, she values the life 
of a despicable old Mushroom Keeper.</i>

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:27.150
<i>Hey, you've got something
 you want to say, right?</i>

00:03:29.150 --> 00:03:33.240
<i>Nothing, you say? That's odd.</i>

00:03:33.240 --> 00:03:35.740
<i>That can't be true. There.</i>

00:03:36.120 --> 00:03:38.320
Stop!

00:03:40.620 --> 00:03:41.800
<i>Milo...</i>

00:03:41.800 --> 00:03:43.730
<i>Take Akaboshi... and run.</i>

00:03:44.070 --> 00:03:48.510
<i>I'll get... old Jabi... out... for sure.</i>

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:52.660
<i>And there you go ad-libbing!</i>

00:03:52.660 --> 00:03:57.170
<i>I need you to stick to the script, y'know.</i>

00:03:59.790 --> 00:04:05.430
<i>Do you honestly think it'll all 
go according to your script,</i>

00:04:05.430 --> 00:04:08.570
<i>and you'll get to see Akaboshi dead, too?</i>

00:04:08.880 --> 00:04:13.600
<i>When you can't even get one 
Rusted woman to do what you want?</i>

00:04:12.400 --> 00:04:14.980
<i>Any more of that and...</i>

00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:16.200
<i>Akaboshi is strong.</i>

00:04:16.200 --> 00:04:21.250
<i>Whatever you're planning, 
he'll bust through it all and kill you.</i>

00:04:21.250 --> 00:04:23.490
<i>You annoying bitch!</i>

00:04:23.490 --> 00:04:26.130
<i>C'mon! Rusted bitch!</i>

00:04:26.130 --> 00:04:28.270
<i>Die! Die! Die!</i>

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:35.120
<i>What an awful woman.</i>

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:38.450
<i>She has no damn problem saying 
shit that'll keep me up at night.</i>

00:04:39.930 --> 00:04:44.120
<i>Well, you can see how she's doing.
She's an impressive woman.</i>

00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:48.750
<i>She wouldn't spill your location 
or the truth about the Rust Eater.</i>

00:04:49.250 --> 00:04:52.430
<i>All I got was this single injection.</i>

00:04:52.760 --> 00:04:58.190
<i>Though, if you can make this, that means
 you know it, don't you, Nekoyanagi?</i>

00:04:58.440 --> 00:05:01.710
<i>You know the true secret 
behind the Rust Eater.</i>

00:05:02.350 --> 00:05:07.930
<i>One week from now, on the next 
auspicious day, I'll kill this woman.</i>

00:05:08.380 --> 00:05:10.280
<i>The terms of the exchange are...</i>

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:13.740
<i>One: the secret to making
the Rust Eater truly effective.</i>

00:05:13.740 --> 00:05:16.430
<i>Two: that red-haired punk.</i>

00:05:16.430 --> 00:05:19.120
<i>Give me those, and you can
 have your sister back.</i>

00:05:19.580 --> 00:05:21.120
<i>So there you have it.</i>

00:05:21.120 --> 00:05:26.270
<i>Bring your partner to the Imihama 
Watch's Shimobuki Base for a date.</i>

00:05:26.270 --> 00:05:28.710
<i>Drop by soon, okay?</i>

00:05:28.710 --> 00:05:30.060
<i>Later.</i>

00:05:31.140 --> 00:05:33.230
Where are you hiding Pawoo?

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:38.290
That punk's got you awfully 
well-trained, Nekoyanagi.

00:05:38.290 --> 00:05:40.470
You're looking pretty sharp now.

00:05:40.470 --> 00:05:43.720
Underestimate me and you'll regret it!

00:05:43.720 --> 00:05:47.140
Ah, hey, hold on now. Hold your horses.

00:05:47.140 --> 00:05:51.490
Going about it like this isn't fair, is it?
Hold up your end of the bargain first.

00:05:51.710 --> 00:05:55.010
Then I hold up my end and 
bring out your sister, right?

00:05:55.010 --> 00:05:59.760
If you want to know the Rust Eater's secret,
you need to have some or we'll get nowhere.

00:05:59.760 --> 00:06:03.280
You're exactly right, Doctor!

00:06:03.280 --> 00:06:05.370
Hey, bring out the Rust Eater!

00:06:07.950 --> 00:06:10.190
This is my pawn.

00:06:10.190 --> 00:06:12.710
Hey, how long do you plan on lying there?

00:06:18.760 --> 00:06:20.270
Now...

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:23.410
How about you show me what to do with it?

00:06:26.240 --> 00:06:30.160
By itself, the Rust Eater
 is in a dormant state.

00:06:30.780 --> 00:06:36.690
You have to mix it with other ingredients 
to awaken it and activate its effects.

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:42.460
I see. That's Imihama's top doctor for you. Now...

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:45.460
What are those white spores?

00:06:49.220 --> 00:06:50.940
He's using mushroom control!

00:06:50.940 --> 00:06:52.350
Kill him!

00:06:59.450 --> 00:07:00.830
What are you doing?!

00:07:00.830 --> 00:07:02.820
Hurry up and kill him!

00:07:04.430 --> 00:07:06.510
Numbshroom spores?

00:07:06.510 --> 00:07:10.590
Why is a kid doctor pulling 
Mushroom Keeper tricks?

00:07:10.590 --> 00:07:12.850
You underestimated me, Kurokawa.

00:07:13.500 --> 00:07:15.840
I'll take you down here!

00:07:16.880 --> 00:07:18.910
I showed you my favor...

00:07:18.910 --> 00:07:21.460
and you got full of yourself! Bastard!

00:07:25.370 --> 00:07:28.130
Time to repay some favors. This is...

00:07:28.420 --> 00:07:29.380
for Pawoo!

00:07:31.290 --> 00:07:32.130
This one...

00:07:32.440 --> 00:07:33.850
is for those children!

00:07:36.090 --> 00:07:37.090
And...

00:07:37.090 --> 00:07:39.040
this one's for Bisco!

00:07:44.650 --> 00:07:45.760
Stop...

00:07:46.530 --> 00:07:47.870
Stop it!

00:07:49.240 --> 00:07:51.640
I coated the blade with numbing poison.

00:07:52.120 --> 00:07:54.080
Soon, it'll stop your heart.

00:07:54.720 --> 00:07:59.100
I'm the only one who can treat it. 
You'd better release Pawoo and Jabi-san—

00:08:03.850 --> 00:08:08.580
You combined the blooming properties of 
boomshroom with numbshroom to make it erupt.

00:08:08.870 --> 00:08:12.250
Plenty of Mushroom Keepers
 have had that same idea.

00:08:12.590 --> 00:08:14.580
Though they weren't able to pull it off.

00:08:14.580 --> 00:08:18.590
It's a technique that can only be 
realized with knowledge of medicine.

00:08:24.910 --> 00:08:27.660
You're impressive, Nekoyanagi.

00:08:27.660 --> 00:08:31.050
I'm shivering just thinking
about what might've happened

00:08:31.050 --> 00:08:35.380
if I hadn't thought of it long ago 
and made a numbshroom antidote.

00:08:35.380 --> 00:08:38.290
How... do you know mushroom techniques?

00:08:38.290 --> 00:08:41.120
How, you ask? Well...

00:08:43.310 --> 00:08:46.370
Because I was a Mushroom Keeper.

00:08:47.530 --> 00:08:50.630
Did you... poison me?

00:08:51.130 --> 00:08:55.110
Puppetshroom is what 
that mushroom is called.

00:08:55.110 --> 00:08:57.650
Its poison does as the name suggests.

00:08:58.040 --> 00:09:02.560
While the puppetshroom's mushroom
spreads its roots throughout your muscles,

00:09:02.560 --> 00:09:06.390
I can use the chip implanted in 
my brain to send it electric signals

00:09:06.390 --> 00:09:09.780
and make you move by just thinking it.

00:09:10.150 --> 00:09:12.360
Just like a toy.

00:09:13.870 --> 00:09:16.140
A terrifying technique, isn't it?

00:09:16.140 --> 00:09:18.470
No one would praise me for it,

00:09:18.990 --> 00:09:23.650
but I used it to make that 
pawn of mine lying over there.

00:09:23.650 --> 00:09:26.220
However, as useful as this technique was,

00:09:26.220 --> 00:09:29.660
the Mushroom Keepers called it 
"fiendish" and refused to tolerate it.

00:09:30.440 --> 00:09:31.910
Nekoyanagi.

00:09:31.910 --> 00:09:36.180
As a show of my respect for you, 
let's have a real heart-to-heart.

00:09:36.680 --> 00:09:38.940
You know, if I'm being honest,

00:09:38.940 --> 00:09:43.590
I have absolutely no interest 
in the effects of the Rust Eater.

00:09:43.590 --> 00:09:46.460
But I do have to monopolize it.

00:09:46.460 --> 00:09:52.680
Do you know what the current Japanese 
government relies on for its revenue?

00:09:53.450 --> 00:09:54.690
It can't be!

00:09:54.690 --> 00:09:58.870
That's right. Those injections for the 
Rusted that the government distributes.

00:09:58.870 --> 00:10:04.450
This world and its economy run on the 
demand for extending the lives of the Rusted.

00:10:04.450 --> 00:10:10.520
Now, imagine if this new wonder drug you're
 making saves all those pitiful people.

00:10:10.520 --> 00:10:15.460
What would happen to the villains 
like me who are lining their pockets?

00:10:15.460 --> 00:10:17.520
We'd be in a tough spot, wouldn't we?

00:10:17.930 --> 00:10:19.260
You fiend!

00:10:21.430 --> 00:10:24.320
If real Rust Eater injections 
fall under my control,

00:10:24.320 --> 00:10:29.740
I won't just be a useful, nefarious governor
 serving the central government anymore.

00:10:30.220 --> 00:10:37.100
The Rust Eater would give Imihama even more
 negotiating power than the central government.

00:10:37.500 --> 00:10:42.870
So will you tell me how to activate
 the Rust Eater's properties already?

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:46.240
At this point, I might even 
spare Akaboshi's head for you.

00:10:46.240 --> 00:10:48.760
You're planning to hunt them 
all down and root it out!

00:10:48.760 --> 00:10:51.190
Just tell me the answer to what I asked you!

00:10:51.190 --> 00:10:53.500
Otherwise, I'll kill you where you stand!

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:55.710
Now say it, Nekoyanagi!

00:10:58.160 --> 00:11:02.170
If you don't answer me, I'll feed 
you to the pigs alive, you hear me?

00:11:06.110 --> 00:11:08.930
Giving me the same damn look your sister did...

00:11:11.400 --> 00:11:14.830
Then I'll have you become my puppet.

00:11:15.320 --> 00:11:20.580
Maybe you'll still be coherent even 
after the poison burrows into your brain.

00:11:22.430 --> 00:11:26.690
<i>Pawoo, Jabi-san... 
I'm sorry I couldn't save you.</i>

00:11:36.800 --> 00:11:38.080
Bisco!

00:11:42.310 --> 00:11:45.290
Jamon Kimnara Hosu Yakshai.

00:11:45.290 --> 00:11:50.730
Enbira Keppa Hosu Yakshai...

00:11:46.410 --> 00:11:48.780
Shut up, old man!

00:11:48.780 --> 00:11:50.730
How long are you gonna keep muttering?!

00:11:52.210 --> 00:11:54.460
You've gone crazy.

00:11:54.460 --> 00:11:58.290
I guess you're some Mushroom 
Keeper hero, but this is pathetic.

00:11:58.290 --> 00:12:02.250
Food... Where's my food? Give me food.

00:12:02.430 --> 00:12:04.660
You're hopeless.

00:12:04.660 --> 00:12:07.500
If you want to eat that 
badly, then I'll feed you.

00:12:10.460 --> 00:12:12.490
Poor old man.

00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:18.430
Hello.

00:12:18.870 --> 00:12:21.400
Yeah, nothing unusual here.

00:12:21.400 --> 00:12:24.720
Just bored out of my mind
 guarding this backwoods old fart.

00:12:24.720 --> 00:12:26.650
I can't keep this up.

00:12:26.940 --> 00:12:30.360
Though, at least it means I don't have 
to listen to the governor's whims.

00:12:31.350 --> 00:12:33.200
Yeah, take care.

00:12:34.870 --> 00:12:35.570
Huh?

00:12:39.500 --> 00:12:40.450
There he is!

00:12:40.450 --> 00:12:42.960
Your very own Tuxedo Mask!

00:12:43.200 --> 00:12:46.520
He's looking a little paler 
than last time, though.

00:12:46.520 --> 00:12:49.740
You can really tell the 
poison's eating away at him.

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:51.790
What's your point?

00:12:51.790 --> 00:12:55.380
You trying to say sardines 
can beat a wounded shark?

00:12:55.580 --> 00:12:59.980
Depends on how wounded it is.
Right now, I might be able to win.

00:12:59.980 --> 00:13:03.600
Even fighting the strongest 
Mushroom Keeper head-on.

00:13:03.810 --> 00:13:06.060
What's with the bags under your eyes?

00:13:06.060 --> 00:13:08.680
You hate me so much, you're losing sleep?

00:13:08.680 --> 00:13:11.690
Whatever your reasons, you can 
hate me as much as you like.

00:13:11.690 --> 00:13:14.850
But I'll forget all about you in no time.

00:13:14.850 --> 00:13:17.980
Even if I told you I'm the 
reason Mushroom Keepers

00:13:17.980 --> 00:13:20.860
have been persecuted this last decade?

00:13:20.860 --> 00:13:21.820
Huh?

00:13:21.820 --> 00:13:24.820
And what if I told you I'm the 
one who spread the superstition

00:13:24.820 --> 00:13:27.860
throughout Japan that 
Mushroom Keepers spread Rust?!

00:13:27.860 --> 00:13:31.840
What if I told you I sold all of you 
innocent Mushroom Keepers out

00:13:31.840 --> 00:13:35.020
to this nation just so 
I could enjoy eating well?

00:13:35.020 --> 00:13:38.870
You still wouldn't want to get to 
know me after that, Akaboshi?

00:13:38.870 --> 00:13:40.110
It was you?!

00:13:40.930 --> 00:13:42.280
I see.

00:13:42.280 --> 00:13:44.260
Thanks for telling me.

00:13:45.310 --> 00:13:48.880
I almost got revenge on the 
side without even knowing it.

00:13:48.880 --> 00:13:50.640
Akaboshi!

00:13:50.640 --> 00:13:54.750
I'll mount your head on the wall like a deer!

00:13:59.050 --> 00:14:00.320
Ow.

00:14:00.900 --> 00:14:02.590
That hurt.

00:14:02.590 --> 00:14:03.950
Are you done now?

00:14:03.950 --> 00:14:06.280
You said you could beat me, Kurokawa.

00:14:06.280 --> 00:14:08.740
Well?! What do you have to say?!

00:14:09.540 --> 00:14:11.530
Bisco! Dodge it!

00:14:19.350 --> 00:14:21.650
This is... Puppetshroom?

00:14:29.550 --> 00:14:32.830
You shot one hell of an arrow...

00:14:33.220 --> 00:14:35.800
If this wasn't a prosthetic, I'd be dead.

00:14:35.800 --> 00:14:37.310
Bastard.

00:14:37.310 --> 00:14:38.800
What did you make Milo shoot?

00:14:39.120 --> 00:14:41.070
A Rust arrow.

00:14:41.070 --> 00:14:44.810
A poisoned arrow with a 
condensed dose of Rusty Wind.

00:14:46.260 --> 00:14:47.810
Wow, scary.

00:14:47.810 --> 00:14:49.860
Just look at those eyes.

00:14:49.860 --> 00:14:52.580
I don't know what else you 
still have up your sleeve.

00:14:53.020 --> 00:14:55.830
Nekoyanagi, let's hit him with another shot.

00:14:56.420 --> 00:14:58.720
No! No, no!

00:14:58.720 --> 00:15:02.140
Please! Don't make me shoot him!

00:15:02.570 --> 00:15:06.570
Hey, now. You're not a kid anymore.

00:15:06.570 --> 00:15:09.750
Don't you know how to ask for a favor?

00:15:09.750 --> 00:15:14.300
Now, what do you say to an 
important person like me? Huh?

00:15:15.410 --> 00:15:19.100
Kurokawa-san, please don't make me shoo—

00:15:19.100 --> 00:15:21.020
Time's up.

00:15:22.820 --> 00:15:23.980
Please...

00:15:24.360 --> 00:15:26.000
Don't shoot Bisco.

00:15:26.850 --> 00:15:28.900
Do what you want with me.

00:15:29.320 --> 00:15:32.630
Just please... spare Bisco.

00:15:33.040 --> 00:15:36.820
You have the card needed 
for that, don't you?

00:15:36.820 --> 00:15:39.360
Tell me the secret of the Rust Eater.

00:15:39.360 --> 00:15:40.550
Milo, don't tell him!

00:15:40.550 --> 00:15:42.530
Tell me, Nekoyanagi!

00:15:42.530 --> 00:15:45.920
The next one I make you fire will 
go straight into Akaboshi's brain!

00:15:45.920 --> 00:15:47.030
Milo!

00:15:50.480 --> 00:15:52.600
Mushroom Keeper blood.

00:15:55.080 --> 00:16:00.010
Take the pure blood of a Mushroom 
Keeper and mix it with the Rust Eater.

00:16:00.740 --> 00:16:04.480
That causes the Rust Eater 
to regain its true properties

00:16:04.980 --> 00:16:07.720
and become a mushroom that devours Rust.

00:16:08.250 --> 00:16:10.920
Well done.

00:16:11.200 --> 00:16:15.960
Now, Nekoyanagi. Naturally, 
you told me that knowing full well

00:16:16.300 --> 00:16:21.590
that there's no way I can allow the 
two of you to leave here alive, right?

00:16:21.950 --> 00:16:23.670
N-No!

00:16:23.670 --> 00:16:25.630
Well, of course you can't.

00:16:25.630 --> 00:16:27.560
I mean, you're so dangerous.

00:16:27.560 --> 00:16:30.640
If I let you go, you'd hunt me down and kill me.

00:16:30.640 --> 00:16:33.160
How could I leave you alive?

00:16:33.590 --> 00:16:36.180
Please... Even if it's just Bisco...

00:16:36.590 --> 00:16:40.260
Okay, very well. Here's your present.

00:16:40.260 --> 00:16:44.030
I'll make it so Akaboshi 
doesn't suffer when I kill him.

00:16:44.030 --> 00:16:46.760
He'll die by his partner's hand. Your hand.

00:16:49.770 --> 00:16:54.170
What a beautiful, tragic scene.

00:16:57.910 --> 00:16:58.840
<i>Bisco?</i>

00:17:16.620 --> 00:17:18.630
Damn you!

00:17:19.380 --> 00:17:20.890
Milo!

00:17:31.310 --> 00:17:32.900
These arrows...

00:17:34.530 --> 00:17:36.800
That was a close call, huh?

00:17:36.800 --> 00:17:38.030
Jabi!

00:17:42.650 --> 00:17:46.390
Fiendish techniques were always 
the one thing you excelled at.

00:17:46.390 --> 00:17:49.700
Well, not that they ever matched 
up to my mushroom control.

00:17:51.630 --> 00:17:54.570
Jabi-san, have you seen Pawoo?

00:17:54.570 --> 00:17:56.530
I haven't found her yet.

00:17:56.530 --> 00:17:58.980
Oh, no need to worry about her.

00:17:58.980 --> 00:17:59.880
Huh?

00:17:59.880 --> 00:18:02.200
I already rescued her.

00:18:17.150 --> 00:18:18.390
Old Jabi?

00:18:19.500 --> 00:18:23.650
This room's awfully bleak for a young
 woman to be staying in, ain't it?

00:18:26.740 --> 00:18:28.160
I'm grateful.

00:18:28.160 --> 00:18:31.330
Go on. No need to linger here.
 Get outta here, quick.

00:18:31.790 --> 00:18:32.890
What about you?

00:18:33.170 --> 00:18:36.750
I'm escaping, too. After I've 
tampered with a few things.

00:18:37.410 --> 00:18:40.780
Go on. Leave it all to this 
old man and get outta here.

00:18:41.180 --> 00:18:42.640
Please, stay safe.

00:18:43.120 --> 00:18:45.560
I promise to repay the favor one day.

00:18:48.510 --> 00:18:49.430
Ow.

00:18:49.750 --> 00:18:52.110
That one earlier must've grazed me.

00:18:59.210 --> 00:19:03.080
When I came to look, I thought it 
couldn't be you two, but it really was.

00:19:03.420 --> 00:19:04.810
Jabi-san.

00:19:08.650 --> 00:19:10.330
Who are these guys?

00:19:10.330 --> 00:19:12.320
Kurokawa's pawns.

00:19:12.320 --> 00:19:14.210
They found us already?

00:19:14.790 --> 00:19:16.640
No matter how many blockheads come—

00:19:17.620 --> 00:19:21.600
Quit acting tough. You won't last
 one more minute with that knee.

00:19:21.870 --> 00:19:25.340
Rust arrows are the one thing my 
mushroom control can't do anything about.

00:19:25.610 --> 00:19:28.410
Listen, boy. Bisco's knees are his wings.

00:19:28.410 --> 00:19:30.600
You promise to keep him alive and heal him?

00:19:30.850 --> 00:19:31.840
Yes!

00:19:32.040 --> 00:19:33.360
You're telling us to run?!

00:19:33.360 --> 00:19:35.610
Jabi, what are you planning on doing?!

00:19:35.800 --> 00:19:38.190
What are you going to 
do without a rearguard?

00:19:38.190 --> 00:19:40.310
I'll escape last.

00:19:40.810 --> 00:19:42.130
Besides...

00:19:42.130 --> 00:19:43.980
I need to pay him back.

00:19:43.980 --> 00:19:47.610
What parent could just stay quiet
 while his son is being wounded?

00:19:49.610 --> 00:19:50.630
Now, go!

00:19:51.920 --> 00:19:53.870
Jabi!

00:19:54.190 --> 00:19:56.560
Don't let them get away!

00:20:00.140 --> 00:20:03.130
I'm your opponent now!

00:20:06.130 --> 00:20:07.390
Ouch.

00:20:14.900 --> 00:20:17.890
Don't let them escape! After them!

00:20:27.650 --> 00:20:28.650
Bisco!

00:20:46.750 --> 00:20:48.180
Milo!

00:21:09.930 --> 00:21:12.020
Milo! Are you okay?

00:21:14.710 --> 00:21:18.790
Bisco... the arrow in your shoulder...

00:21:18.790 --> 00:21:21.390
Dummy! You're way worse off than me!

00:21:21.390 --> 00:21:22.750
Don't talk too much.

00:21:23.380 --> 00:21:24.760
Bisco.

00:21:24.760 --> 00:21:26.770
What is it? Does it hurt?

00:21:29.770 --> 00:21:31.280
Don't die.

00:21:41.070 --> 00:21:42.420
You dumbass.

00:23:24.920 --> 00:23:37.270
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

00:23:24.920 --> 00:23:37.270
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

00:23:25.930 --> 00:23:26.930
I know...

00:23:28.000 --> 00:23:31.240
I know what I am.

00:23:32.670 --> 00:23:34.080
What about you?

00:23:35.230 --> 00:23:37.890
Next episode: "I Love You."

00:23:37.270 --> 00:23:39.930
<b>I Love You</b>
